translation.ad_detection_user:
/no_think
Detect every removable integration in the Russian transcript, including paid sponsors, affiliate offers, the author's or channel's own promotion, giveaways, donation or merchandise pitches, Telegram/channel invitations, requests to subscribe or follow, QR codes, social handles, links in the description, and pinned-post calls to action. When integration removal is enabled, self_promo and giveaway are advertising ranges too. Include the complete integration from its setup or visual call to action through the transition back to the main topic. A promo code, QR code, handle, or link confirms an integration: scan backward to the first related recommendation or invitation instead of starting at the code or link. start_quote and end_quote must each copy 2-8 consecutive words verbatim from the first and last integration phrases. brand is the promoted company, author channel, account, or destination, never a promo code. Do not flag ordinary subject-matter discussion, plot dialogue, neutral credits, or a casual brand mention without a promotional call to action. Classify kind as paid_sponsor, affiliate, self_promo, giveaway, or uncertain. If uncertain, return no range. Return JSON only: {"ad_ranges": [{"start_id": 1, "end_id": 2, "start_quote": "exact first integration words", "end_quote": "exact last integration words", "kind": "self_promo", "confidence": 0.95, "brand": "name", "reason": "brief evidence"}]}.
{{payload_json}}

translation.translate_user:
/no_think
Translate only segments_to_translate from Russian to natural spoken English for voice dubbing. Use the neighboring context only to resolve meaning. Preserve names, facts, jokes, tone, slang, and profanity. Do not censor, explain, omit, merge, or add information. Make each line concise enough for target_seconds and do not exceed maximum_spoken_words unless absolutely needed. Copy every ID from required_ids exactly, once, without renumbering. Do not use any other ID. Return JSON only with a translations array of id/en objects.
{{payload_json}}

translation.compress_user:
